            <ArticleTitle>SCLEROSING MICROCYSTIC ADNEXAL CARCINOMA OF THE SCALP (CASE REPORT).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>12-14</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Microcystic adnexal carcinoma is a rare malignant sweat gland tumor. We present the case report of a 63 year old male patient who developed this malignancy on the scalp, which is an uncommon site. The tumor has been removed by delayed MOHS technique with no relapse. The differential diagnoses and treatment options are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
